{"3476800": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Anturi", "steam_appid": 3476800, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the course of the game, you explore various islands and help the inhabitants to find out information about your father's fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many new skills to learn and adventures to experience along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful, the world has many stories to tell, secrets to uncover and dangers to overcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So what are you waiting for? Find your own path and follow your heart in the world of Anturi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When his father fails to return home in search of resources, Wikku decides to leave the safety of his homeland and venture into the unknown world of Anturi.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476800/extras/a41ef9a87c726436fe758d1218145003.avif?t=1739525104\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476800/extras_big/a41ef9a87c726436fe758d1218145003.avif?t=1739525104 width=800 height=414 /></span>But there are unknown dangers out there. As soon as you enter their territory, the environment becomes bleak and you feel sick and weak, so be careful. <br>And look for ways to stop this corruption.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476800/extras/790753e8e7b378979437c07f445d02c4.avif?t=1739525104\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476800/extras_big/790753e8e7b378979437c07f445d02c4.avif?t=1739525104 width=800 height=338 /></span>Gameplay<br>Use the boomerang to destroy all the Heartless and cause chaos.or find ways to avoid them.your play style is completely up to you!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476800/extras/d08eab5e1aaf9280c9f160786db994c7.avif?t=1739525104\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476800/extras_big/d08eab5e1aaf9280c9f160786db994c7.avif?t=1739525104 width=800 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disclaimer:</strong><i>Anturi consists of two of the planned nine levels and the development has been completed for the time being. </i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the course of the game, you explore various islands and help the inhabitants to find out information about your father's fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many new skills to learn and adventures to experience along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful, the world has many stories to tell, secrets to uncover and dangers to overcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So what are you waiting for? Find your own path and follow your heart in the world of Anturi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When his father fails to return home in search of resources, Wikku decides to leave the safety of his homeland and venture into the unknown world of Anturi.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476800/extras/a41ef9a87c726436fe758d1218145003.avif?t=1739525104\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476800/extras_big/a41ef9a87c726436fe758d1218145003.avif?t=1739525104 width=800 height=414 /></span>But there are unknown dangers out there. As soon as you enter their territory, the environment becomes bleak and you feel sick and weak, so be careful. <br>And look for ways to stop this corruption.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/